In the first iteration of the program, we made sure that we can move the stepper 90 degrees with the manual switch.
We also made sure the LED turned on when the switch was pressed.
We built the base of our collection container out of popsicle sticks and cardboard, ensuring the lid can be moved with the stepper.
We had to change the servo to the stepper, as the servo was not strong enough to move the lid.

